{
  "$comment": [
    "气闸的配置。这份文件会进仓库，所以里面**不允许出现任何明文密钥**——",
    "凭据只写引用：secretEnv 是环境变量名，secretFile 是文件路径。",
    "加载时会扫一遍，键名像秘密或者值长得像已知凭据的，直接拒绝启动。",
    "字符串里可以用 ${VAR} 或 ${VAR:-默认值} 引用环境变量。"
  ],

  "broker": {
    "hostPort": 8788,
    "cellHost": "${ABX_CELL_HOST:-host.docker.internal}",
    "cellPort": 8789,
    "cellTokenEnv": "ABX_CELL_TOKEN",
    "allowCellTokenInPath": true,
    "auditPath": "${ABX_AUDIT_PATH:-./abx-audit.jsonl}",
    "requestTimeoutMs": 120000
  },

  "egress": {
    "$comment": [
      "默认拒绝：只有列在这里的域名才放行，空数组表示全部拒绝。",
      "三种写法：api.anthropic.com 精确；*.example.com 只含子域；.example.com 含自身与子域。",
      "下游请求 /u/<upstreamId>/... 时白名单同样生效——不是给域名配了上游就能绕过去。"
    ],
    "allow": [
      { "pattern": "api.anthropic.com", "upstreamId": "anthropic" },
      { "pattern": "api.openai.com", "upstreamId": "openai" },
      { "pattern": "*.openai.com", "upstreamId": "openai" },
      "api.example.com"
    ]
  },

  "upstreams": [
    {
      "id": "anthropic",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.anthropic.com",
      "authHeader": "authorization",
      "authScheme": "Bearer",
      "secretEnv": "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY"
    },
    {
      "id": "openai",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.openai.com",
      "authHeader": "authorization",
      "authScheme": "Bearer",
      "secretEnv": "OPENAI_API_KEY"
    },
    {
      "$comment": "dsh 是占位定义，地址和变量名都还没核实过。用之前先确认。",
      "id": "dsh",
      "baseUrl": "https://api.example.com",
      "authHeader": "authorization",
      "authScheme": "Bearer",
      "secretEnv": "DSH_API_KEY"
    }
  ],

  "session": {
    "$comment": [
      "backend 默认是 docker。想换成 local 的话，先读一遍 packages/session/source/local-backend.ts 顶部那段——",
      "它不是沙箱，禁止用于演示。",
      "local 后端下 broker 的舱面会自动改绑 127.0.0.1，不需要改 cellHost。",
      "不写 image 时用所选 agent 清单里的镜像（见 packages/contracts/source/agents.ts）；",
      "要跑一个跟 agent 无关的裸容器做验证，才在这里显式写一个镜像。"
    ],
    "backend": "docker",
    "user": "1000:1000",
    "network": "bridge",
    "workdir": "/workspace",
    "limits": {
      "memory": "2g",
      "pids": 256,
      "cpus": 2
    },
    "tmpfsSizeMb": 64
  }
}
